**netwhy** `example.com`: the **dns** layer failed

| Layer | Status | Result |
|---|---|---|
| system | pass | interface up |
| dns | fail | no DNS resolver answered (timeout or unreachable) |
| tcp | skipped | skipped because dns did not work |

